1
00:00:00,483 --> 00:00:02,053
(Raj:)You sure?

2
00:00:02,051 --> 00:00:03,081
(Leonard:)Look.

3
00:00:03,085 --> 00:00:04,785
(Howard:)The system is maintaining
its own stability,

4
00:00:04,787 --> 00:00:07,717
(Howard:)the quantum vortex apparatus is
now controlling the orientation.

5
00:00:07,723 --> 00:00:09,453
(inhales)

6
00:00:09,459 --> 00:00:11,589
(Raj:)You're right.

7
00:00:11,594 --> 00:00:12,924
(Raj:)You realize what this means?

8
00:00:12,929 --> 00:00:14,799
(Penny:)Yeah.

9
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:16,567
(Penny:)I do.

10
00:00:16,566 --> 00:00:19,836
(Howard:)It's proof of concept.

11
00:00:19,836 --> 00:00:21,706
(Howard:)We've got a
workable guidance system.

12
00:00:21,704 --> 00:00:24,734
(Raj:)Congratulations.

13
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:28,440
Thanks!
(chuckles)

14
00:00:28,444 --> 00:00:29,814
(computer chimes)

15
00:00:29,812 --> 00:00:31,182
(Leonard:)Hey,

16
00:00:31,180 --> 00:00:34,550
(Howard:)I just got an e-mail
from the U.S. Air Force.

17
00:00:34,550 --> 00:00:36,350
(Raj:)Open it.

18
00:00:36,352 --> 00:00:37,552
(Howard:)Hmm.

19
00:00:37,553 --> 00:00:39,483
"We request a meeting at your
earliest convenience

20
00:00:39,489 --> 00:00:41,289
"regarding your
quantum guidance system,

21
00:00:41,290 --> 00:00:44,860
provisional patent 62/295118."

22
00:00:44,861 --> 00:00:48,031
(Howard:)That's weird.

23
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:52,230
(Raj:)Is there a window around
here we don't know about?

24
00:00:52,235 --> 00:00:54,465
(Howard:)I'm sure
it's just a coincidence.

25
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,440
(Raj:)Yeah, of course.

26
00:00:55,438 --> 00:00:56,908
(Raj:)What else could it be?

27
00:00:56,906 --> 00:01:03,026
(raised voice):
Boy, do I love America.

